nder the 'special' category. Moreover, this would be unnecessary as there are already many options to resolve these issues inside the existing Visual Shader Node-set. I have attached screenshots of the node configurations described by this issue, with descriptions of simple, alternate Node configurations that achieve the same effect.\n\n<img width=\"839\" height=\"482\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4633614b-0da5-4f21-8be7-b9353d4af60b\" />\n\n<img width=\"784\" height=\"395\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a57f39b0-d72b-4fdd-a990-f12b08bfbdaf\" />\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3716837976/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]